OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil calls for accountability
OL,4,Aover sea sewage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbrian Water said it was the
OL,7,FEnvironment Agency's (EA)
OL,8,Fresponsibility to tell the council,
OL,9,Fwith the EA saying it ran tests to find
OL,10,Fthere was "no risk" to bathers.
